Description:It is your second main phase. You control Gaea's Cradle ({T}: add {G} for each creature you control), two untapped Mountains and Grizzly Bears, and have Memnite, Ornithopter and Lava Axe ({4}{R}: 5 damage to target player) in hand. The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-mana-ability-counts-on-activation | A mana ability's amount is determined as it is activated (CR 605.3, 106.4): cast the free Memnite and Ornithopter first, then the Cradle makes three green, and with the Mountains Lava Axe is paid; tapping the Cradle first makes only one green
